{"ID":"20230925154210-993nfla","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230925154210-993nfla","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154210-993nfla\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154222-5qseu02\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154222-vu29g3v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154222-vu29g3v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:27,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:27\u0026#125;","title":"【黄土汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230925154222"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925154222-5qseu02","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154222-5qseu02","updated":"20230925154222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：灶中黄土半斤、甘草三两、地黄三两、白术三两、附子三两（炮）、阿胶三两、黄芩三两"}]},{"ID":"20230925154222-icrj18v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154222-icrj18v","updated":"20230925154222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右七味，以水八升，煮取三升，去滓，分温三服。"}]},{"ID":"20230925154222-9y50zu7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154222-9y50zu7","updated":"20230925154222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【15.4】吐血不止者，柏叶汤主之；黄土汤亦主之。"}]},{"ID":"20230925154222-vu29g3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154222-vu29g3v","updated":"20230925154222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【15.6】下血，先便而后血者，此远血也，黄土汤主之；"}]}]}